  "explanation": "The source documents explicitly state that Magdalena Radović was affiliated with two distinct organizations. Document 1 (D1S2, D1S3, etc.) confirms her affiliation with the 'Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences' in Serbia. Document 2 (D2S2, D2S4) confirms her affiliation with 'Imperial College London' in the UK. The 'University of Belgrade' (C2) is mentioned only as the parent institution of the Vinča Institute, not as her direct employer. Funding bodies like 'Wellcome Trust' (C3) and 'European Research Council' (C4) provided funding, not employment. Departments ('Faculty of Medicine', C5; 'Department of Medicine', C6) are subdivisions of the employer, not the primary organization itself. Journals ('Nature Medicine', C7), collaborators ('top pharmaceutical companies', C8), and individuals (C9-C12) are not employers. Therefore, only the two specific institutes are retained as valid answers."
